prompt.fr:
`touchRead` renvoie 15. Que fait la LED ?

```cpp
const uint32_t TOUCH_THRESHOLD = 30;
uint32_t value = touchRead(TOUCH_PIN);  // value = 15
bool touched = (value < TOUCH_THRESHOLD);
digitalWrite(LED_PIN, touched ? HIGH : LOW);
```

